 Y7yDwDZsbBVx3HlgQ/viewform\n\nHosted by TTC Riders
  (https://www.ttcriders.ca)\n\nUnequal access to affordable\,
  high-quality\, and frequent public transit is a public health and equity
  issue that disproportionately affects low-income people\, people with
  disabilities\, and Black\, Indigenous\, and people of colour in Toronto.
  The TTC Riders have two long-term goals: Fixing the transit funding model
  and Building transit rider power and leadership. 
END:VEVENT
