SUMMARY:Community Drive - by Toronto Centre and Spadina-Fort York for
  Palestine
LOCATION:Trinity Bellwoods Park\, David Crombie Park
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/Ddpi_cOCXaz/\n\nHosted
  by Toronto Centre and Spadina-Fort York for Palestine ()\n\nJoin this
  monthly community drive to make a difference in the lives of a large\,
  struggling family in Gaza and Torontonians who receive weekly groceries
