SUMMARY:Civic Meetup #562: Ban the Kid\, Keep their Data - by Civic Tech
  Toronto
LOCATION:Address available to attendees
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://guild.host/events/civic-meetup-562-ban-3yn1pp\n\nHosted by Civic
  Tech Toronto (https://civictech.ca/)\n\nGovernments in Canada and abroad
  are moving to protect children online: banning kids from social media\,
  mandating safer defaults\, restricting what platforms can recommend to
  young users. In this talk\, Sara Grimes looks at the infrastructure these
  proposals routinely require\, including AI-driven facial estimation and
  behavioural inference\, applied to everyone.
END:VEVENT
